<title>USA: FDA to allow Quaker claim for oat bran-WSJ.</title>
<headline>FDA to allow Quaker claim for oat bran-WSJ.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Food and Drug Administration says it will give a final ruling allowing Quaker Oats Co and others to make a health claim for oat bran, the Wall Street Journal said Tuesday.</p>
<p>The report quoted FDA officials, saying that Quaker and other food companies will be able to claim that soluble fibre in whole-oats products could cut chances of heart disease.</p>
<p>-- New York newsdesk 212-859-1610</p>
</text>
